=== CORRECTION: 'res.signature.r' probe above was mislabeled ===
it flipped byte sig_off-1 = 279, which is alignment PADDING inside the payload
window (payload[1] covers [264,277), sig_off=280): padding bytes lie outside every
described region, are not authenticated by design (payloads are bound via the
signed table's per-entry sha256) and must never be interpreted by any parser.
Correctly-targeted probes:
res.signature.r[0] (sig_off+8): rejected [-17] ECDSA P-256 signature over fixed_header+manifest+payload_table is invalid
res.payload[1].last_byte (276): rejected [-19] payload 1 sha256 does not match
res.padding_byte (279) - expected ACCEPT (dead byte): accepted
PROBE_EXIT=0

